12:# Diplodoc transform
13-
14:Core transformation package for the Diplodoc platform. Converts Yandex Flavored Markdown (YFM) to HTML with support for interactive components and extensible plugin architecture.
15-
16-Use it in your code to work with text during program execution. For example, to display user-generated content.
17-
18-## Features
19-
20:- **YFM to HTML transformation** — Core markdown processing with YFM extensions
21-- **Plugin system** — Extensible architecture using extension packages (cut, tabs, file)
22-- **Client-side runtime** — Interactive components (tabs, cuts, terms, anchors, etc.)
23-- **SCSS styles** — Comprehensive styling system with CSS variables
--
